OL,3,GNEWSABus and train collide on French
OL,4,Aside of Channel Tunnel with at least 19
OL,5,Ahurt
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 19 people are injured
OL,8,Ffollowing a crash between a freight
OL,9,Ftrain and a bus at the entrance to the
OL,10,FChannel Tunnel in France
OL,12,FLocal officials in Pas-de-Calais say
OL,13,Fthe incident occurred where vehicles
OL,14,Fwere boarding the Le Shuttle at the
OL,15,Floading platform for the Eurotunnel
OL,17,FNo deaths have been reported and no
OL,18,Flives are in danger, officials say
OL,20,FEmergency services are at the scene,
OL,21,Fwith authorities set to provide an
OL,22,Fupdate later tonight
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
